    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"unverified rumors\" is a pretty strong way to put it. it feels like some people are pointing out specific things, like how the chain of custody works or how the signature verification software might have flaws. if those are just \"rumors,\" what actually makes the system so \"undeniably secure\"?",
